  "research_question": "Can JEPA-inspired self-supervised pretraining produce representations that improve downstream decision-making when fewer labeled examples are available?",
  "experimental_hypothesis": "Self-supervised latent predictive pretraining (JEPA) on unlabelled environment states learns abstract semantic representations that improve downstream decision accuracy, especially under label scarcity (10% to 50% labeled subsets).",
